WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.091
You set up a brand new mailbox, and send your first cold email.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:05.631
Straight to spam.

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:11.527
New mailboxes have no reputation yet. So before your campaigns go out, warm them up.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:20.640
With Datamart Warmup, you create a workspace for your company, and connect your sending mailboxes. Google, Microsoft, or any other inbox.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:29.605
Then your mailboxes trade email with mailboxes from other agencies in the network. They open it, reply to it, and rescue it from spam.

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:33.484
A little more every day, so your reputation builds up naturally.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:37.904
You can see every mailbox's health, and exactly where your mail lands.

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:42.859
And it's free. Datamart covers the bill. Create your free workspace today.
